# BEST-OF-AI-DEV template v1. Paths an agent must not change without the owner seeing it.
# CODEOWNERS only binds when the main ruleset has "Require review from Code Owners", and
# GitHub never lets an author approve their own PR. If agents push as the owner's account,
# this file requests nothing: give agents their own identity (see docs: Independent review).
# The last matching pattern wins, so the catch-all comes first.

# REPO-SPECIFIC: replace @OWNER with real users or teams. Add the repo's sensitive paths.
* @OWNER
/.github/ @OWNER
/.githooks/ @OWNER
/scripts/ @OWNER
/AGENTS.md @OWNER
/RULES.md @OWNER
/package.json @OWNER
/package-lock.json @OWNER
# /REPO-SPECIFIC
